flowchart TD
    subgraph App["Application"]
        Req["ComputeRequest{required: CapabilitySet}"]
    end

    Req --> Compute["compute.execute(request, payload)"]

    Compute --> Map["capability_mapping.selectTarget()"]

    subgraph Registry["TargetRegistry (max 64)"]
        CpuBig["cpu_big"]
        CpuLittle["cpu_little"]
        Gpu["gpu"]
        Npu["npu"]
        Dpu["dpu"]
        SmartNic["smartnic"]
        Fpga["fpga"]
        AiAcc["ai_accelerator"]
        Tpu["tpu"]
    end

    Map -->|scans available targets| Registry
    Map -->|hard-requirement best match| Chosen["Chosen ExecutionTarget"]

    Chosen --> ExecuteFn["ExecuteFn seam (future backend)"]
    ExecuteFn --> Result["ExecutionResult{target_kind, target_id, succeeded}"]

    subgraph Discovery["Accelerator discovery"]
        DiscoverFn["DiscoverFn seam (future PCIe/vendor/firmware probe)"]
    end

    DiscoverFn -->|discoverAndRegister| Registry

    Chosen -->|becomes unavailable| Migration["migration.planAndMigrate()"]
    Migration -->|re-selectTarget| Map
    Migration --> MigrateFn["MigrateFn seam (future state transfer)"]
    MigrateFn --> NewChosen["New ExecutionTarget"]
